    "title": "Winter Mix to Hit Texas and Oklahoma With Snow, Sleet, and Freezing Rain Late Wednesday Into Thursday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Avery Hughes ,\n20 hours ago OKLAHOMA — A new round of winter precipitation is forecast to move across Texas and Oklahoma beginning Wednesday night into Thursday morning, with a messy mix of snow, sleet, and freezing rain expected in several areas. Forecasters warn that even light accumulations could create slick and hazardous roads, especially in the Texas Panhandle, western Oklahoma, and areas south of Interstate 40. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 24",
